="00:25.845" end="00:27.326">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.414" end="00:35.558"><span begin="00:29.414" end="00:29.614">Is </span><span begin="00:29.614" end="00:29.886">my </span><span begin="00:29.886" end="00:30.350">heart </span><span begin="00:30.350" end="00:30.670">not </span><span begin="00:30.670" end="00:31.711">enough </span><span begin="00:32.102" end="00:32.382">to </span><span begin="00:32.382" end="00:32.717">keep </span><span begin="00:32.717" end="00:33.053">you </span><span begin="00:33.053" end="00:33.542">right </span><span begin="00:33.542" end="00:34.061">here </span><span begin="00:34.061" end="00:34.349">next </span><span begin="00:34.349" end="00:34.646">to </span><span begin="00:34.646" end="00:35.558">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.678" end="00:41.622"><span begin="00:36.678" end="00:36.885">It's </span><span begin="00:36.885" end="00:37.190">just </span><span begin="00:37.190" end="00:37.605">not </span><span begin="00:37.605" end="00:37.942">what </span><span begin="00:37.942" end="00:38.278">it </span><span begin="00:38.278" end="00:39.030">was </span><span begin="00:39.326" end="00:39.542">you're </span><span begin="00:39.542" end="00:40.005">pushing </span><span begin="00:40.005" end="00:40.342">me </span><span begin="00:40.342" end="00:41.622">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.349" end="00:48.774"><span begin="00:43.349" end="00:43.950">Oh </span><span begin="00:43.950" end="00:44.102">the </span><span begin="00:44.102" end="00:44.574">way </span><span begin="00:44.758" end="00:44.926">that </span><span begin="00:44.926" end="00:45.270">we </span><span begin="00:45.270" end="00:45.661">are </span><span begin="00:45.661" end="00:46.622">falling </span><span begin="00:46.845" end="00:47.214">ain't </span><span begin="00:47.214" end="00:47.495">the </span><span begin="00:47.495" end="00:48.774">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.774" end="00:52.598"><span begin="00:49.774" end="00:50.031">Is </span><span begin="00:50.031" end="00:50.342">this </span><span begin="00:50.342" end="00:50.839">love </span><span begin="00:50.839" end="00:51.182">to </span><span begin="00:51.182" end="00:52.598">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.270" end="00:56.230"><span begin="00:53.270" end="00:53.558">Is </span><span begin="00:53.558" end="00:53.910">this </span><span begin="00:53.910" end="00:54.438">what </span><span begin="00:54.438" end="00:54.782">you </span><span begin="00:54.782" end="00:56.230">choose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.727" end="01:02.543"><span begin="00:56.727" end="00:57.127">How </span><span begin="00:57.127" end="00:57.424">did </span><span begin="00:57.424" end="00:57.975">you </span><span begin="00:57.975" end="00:58.887">become </span><span begin="00:59.079" end="00:59.350">so </span><span begin="00:59.350" end="01:00.431">heartless </span><span begin="01:00.679" end="01:01.535">so </span><span begin="01:01.535" end="01:02.543">soon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.767" end="01:04.919"><span begin="01:02.767" end="01:03.247">So </span><span begin="01:03.247" end="01:04.919">soon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.158" end="01:08.815"><span begin="01:05.158" end="01:05.432">I </span><span begin="01:05.432" end="01:05.599">can </span><span begin="01:05.599" end="01:06.319">never </span><span begin="01:06.535" end="01:06.873">ask </span><span begin="01:07.119" end="01:07.639">for </span><span begin="01:07.639" end="01:08.167">something </span><span begin="01:08.167" end="01:08.815">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.071" end="01:15.258"><span begin="01:09.071" end="01:09.487">If </span><span begin="01:09.487" end="01:10.142">this </span><span begin="01:10.142" end="01:10.958">is </span><span begin="01:11.158" end="01:12.086">love </span><span begin="01:12.294" end="01:12.998">to </span><span begin="01:12.998" end="01:15.258">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.937" end="01:18.746"><span b